FONT-MISC-MISC
==============

A git submodule (see docs/contrib.md), not a copy of the sources:

url    = https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/font/misc-misc.git
tag    = font-misc-misc-1.1.3
commit = c4e2af05583764fae3d0b2aa20d5c93b031cbcbf
date   = 2023-02-27

tools/desktop/build-fonts.sh builds its BDF fonts into PCF with
contrib/bdftopcf and the ISO8859-*, KOI8-R and JISX0201 conversions with
ucs2any (contrib/font-util), and installs them in
/usr/local/share/fonts/misc, where XLibre's default font path reads them
(foxyn-desktop(8) runs it on the desktop image).

Not built: the truncated fonts (bdftruncate), compressed PCF, and the
75dpi, 100dpi and cyrillic sets (their fonts.alias entries stay unresolved).
Nothing is written into the submodule.

Licence: see COPYING.  When upgrading, check the lists in build-fonts.sh
against Makefile.am (the BDF2UCS_* variables) and the new files.
